flowchart TD

    A[User requests feature] --> B{Feature enabled?}

    B -->|No| End404[Return 404]
    B -->|Yes| LoadPerms[Load feature permissions]

    LoadPerms --> DenyGroups[Evaluate DENY groups]

    DenyGroups --> DenyMatch{User belongs to any DENY group?}

    DenyMatch -->|Yes| End403[Return 403]
    DenyMatch -->|No| AllowGroups[Evaluate ALLOW groups]

    AllowGroups --> StaticMember{User is a static group member?}

    StaticMember -->|Yes| Success[Allow access]

    StaticMember -->|No| HasDynamicRules{Group has dynamic rules?}

    HasDynamicRules -->|No| End403

    HasDynamicRules -->|Yes| ValidateRules{User satisfies dynamic rules?}

    ValidateRules -->|Yes| Success
    ValidateRules -->|No| End403